    "Telnyx connection ID": "Telnyx ryšio ID",
    "The Telnyx voice application calls are placed through. \"Set up Telnyx\" creates it for you; its webhook URL is kept up to date automatically.": "Telnyx balso programa, per kurią skambinama. \"Nustatyti Telnyx\" ją sukuria už jus; jos žiniatinklio kablio URL automatiškai atnaujinamas.",
